# YakkamonWorld response headers (Cloudflare Workers static assets).
# Applied to every path matched below. Like _redirects, this file is read by
# Cloudflare and never served.
#
# HSTS: once a browser has seen the site over https it will rewrite any later
# http://yakkamonworld.com/... request to https:// itself before sending it.
# This complements — does NOT replace — the zone-level "Always Use HTTPS"
# toggle in the Cloudflare dashboard (SSL/TLS → Edge Certificates), which is
# what actually 301s a first-time http:// visit (Googlebot included).
# No "preload" and no "includeSubDomains" on purpose: both are hard to undo.

/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
